<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="th">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0">
<title>ระบบจัดการรูปภาพ & รายงานตู้สินค้า</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Prompt:wght@400;600;700;800&family=Sarabun:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/jspdf/2.5.1/jspdf.umd.min.js"></script>
<script src="https://www.youtube.com/iframe_api"></script>
<style>
body[data-theme="brown"]{--bg:#1a120b;--card:#2b1e16;--sub:#3c2a1e;--text:#f5ebe0;--mut:#d5bdaf;--bdr:#4e382b;--pri:#d49a55;--pri-h:#ba813e;--in:#221811}
body[data-theme="white"]{--bg:#f8fafc;--card:#fff;--sub:#f1f5f9;--text:#0f172a;--mut:#64748b;--bdr:#e2e8f0;--pri:#2563eb;--pri-h:#1d4ed8;--in:#fff}
body[data-theme="black"]{--bg:#09090b;--card:#18181b;--sub:#27272a;--text:#f4f4f5;--mut:#a1a1aa;--bdr:#2e2e33;--pri:#3b82f6;--pri-h:#2563eb;--in:#222226}
body[data-theme="pink"]{--bg:#fff1f2;--card:#fff;--sub:#ffe4e6;--text:#4c0519;--mut:#9f1239;--bdr:#fecdd3;--pri:#e11d48;--pri-h:#be123c;--in:#fff}
body[data-theme="gray"]{--bg:#1e293b;--card:#334155;--sub:#475569;--text:#f8fafc;--mut:#cbd5e1;--bdr:#475569;--pri:#38bdf8;--pri-h:#0ea5e9;--in:#243247}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0;font-family:'Prompt','Sarabun',sans-serif;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent}
body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);padding:14px;padding-bottom:50px;line-height:1.5;transition:background .2s,color .2s;min-height:100vh}
.container{max-width:600px;margin:0 auto}
.top-bar{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;margin-bottom:14px;gap:8px;text-align:center}
.stats-box{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--bdr);border-radius:14px;padding:8px 14px;width:100%;max-width:420px;margin:4px auto;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.04);text-align:center}
.live-clock{font-size:.82rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--pri);margin-bottom:6px}
.counter-row{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.counter-badge{background:var(--sub);border:1px solid var(--bdr);border-radius:20px;padding:3px 10px;font-size:.76rem;color:var(--text);font-weight:600}
.counter-num{color:var(--pri);font-weight:700}
.theme-selector{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--bdr);padding:6px 14px;border-radius:30px}
.theme-dot{width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:50%;cursor:pointer;border:2px solid transparent}
.theme-dot.active{border-color:var(--pri);transform:scale(1.15)}
.tabs{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr 1.1fr;background:var(--sub);padding:4px;border-radius:14px;margin-bottom:14px;gap:4px;border:1px solid var(--bdr)}
.tab-btn{padding:10px 2px;border:none;background:none;border-radius:10px;font-size:.82rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--mut);cursor:pointer;text-align:center}
.tab-btn.active{background:var(--card);color:var(--pri);box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.08)}
.tab-panel{display:none}.tab-panel.active{display:block}
.card{background:var(--card);border-radius:16px;padding:16px;border:1px solid var(--bdr);box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.04);margin-bottom:14px}
.card-title{font-size:1rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:12px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}
.form-group{margin-bottom:10px}
label{display:block;font-size:.82rem;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:4px;color:var(--mut)}
input[type="text"],input[type="number"],select{width:100%;padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid var(--bdr);background:var(--in);color:var(--text);border-radius:10px;font-size:.95rem;outline:none;transition:border-color .15s}
input:disabled{opacity:0.65;cursor:not-allowed}
input.input-focused{border-color:var(--pri);box-shadow:0 0 0 2px rgba(212,154,85,0.25)}
.upload-grid-2,.upload-grid-4{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px;margin-bottom:12px}
.upload-box{border:2px dashed var(--bdr);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 6px;text-align:center;background:var(--sub);position:relative;min-height:120px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
.upload-box input[type="file"]{position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;opacity:0;cursor:pointer}
.upload-box .preview-thumb{max-width:100%;max-height:85px;border-radius:6px;margin-top:6px;object-fit:cover;display:none}
.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:100%;padding:11px;background:var(--pri);color:#fff;border:none;border-radius:12px;font-size:.92rem;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;text-decoration:none;gap:6px}
.btn:hover{background:var(--pri-h)}
.btn-success{background:#16a34a}.btn-batch{background:var(--sub);color:var(--text);border:1px dashed var(--bdr);font-size:.85rem;padding:8px;margin-bottom:12px}
.result-container{text-align:center;margin-top:14px;display:none}
.result-canvas-wrap{max-width:100%;background:#fff;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;margin:0 auto 12px auto;border:1px solid var(--bdr);box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,.15)}
canvas{display:block;width:100%;height:auto}
.video-wrap{position:relative;padding-bottom:56.25%;height:0;overflow:hidden;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid var(--bdr);margin-bottom:12px;background:#000}
.video-wrap iframe{position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;border:none}
.ctrl-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px;margin-bottom:12px}
.palette-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.color-chip{width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;border:2px solid var(--bdr)}
.color-chip.active{border-color:var(--pri);transform:scale(1.1)}
.filter-row{display:flex;gap:6px;margin-bottom:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.filter-btn{flex:1;padding:8px 8px;background:var(--sub);border:1px solid var(--bdr);border-radius:10px;color:var(--text);font-size:0.8rem;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;transition:all .15s;text-align:center}
.filter-btn.active{background:var(--pri);color:#fff;border-color:var(--pri)}


/* Backup notice (ช่องติ๊กสำรองรูปลง Drive) */
.backup-box{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:8px;width:100%;max-width:420px;background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--bdr);border-radius:12px;padding:8px 12px;font-size:.78rem;font-weight:400;color:var(--mut);text-align:left;cursor:pointer;margin:0}
.backup-box input{width:auto;margin-top:4px;flex-shrink:0}
.backup-box small{display:block;font-size:.72rem;opacity:.85}


/* Toast */
.toast{position:fixed;left:50%;bottom:24px;transform:translateX(-50%);background:var(--card);color:var(--text);border:1px solid var(--bdr);padding:10px 16px;border-radius:12px;font-size:.85rem;font-weight:600;box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.3);z-index:10000;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:opacity .2s;max-width:90%;text-align:center}
.toast.show{opacity:1}


/* Secret Calendar Button */
.secret-btn-wrap{display:flex;justify-content:center;margin-top:24px;padding:10px;}
.secret-cal-btn{background:none;border:none;font-size:1.15rem;cursor:pointer;opacity:0.35;transition:opacity .2s;padding:6px;border-radius:50%}
.secret-cal-btn:hover{opacity:0.9;transform:scale(1.1)}


/* PIN Pad Modal */
.pin-btn{background:var(--sub);border:1px solid var(--bdr);color:var(--text);font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:700;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 0;cursor:pointer;transition:background .1s}
.pin-btn:active{background:var(--pri);color:#fff}


/* Calendar View */
#calView{display:none}
.cal-header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:12px}
.cal-nav-btn{background:var(--sub);color:var(--text);border:1px solid var(--bdr);padding:6px 12px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;font-weight:700}
.cal-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(7,1fr);gap:4px;text-align:center}
.cal-day-head{font-size:0.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--mut);padding:6px 0}
.cal-cell{background:var(--sub);border:1px solid var(--bdr);border-radius:8px;padding:6px 2px;min-height:56px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-start;cursor:pointer;transition:transform .1s}
.cal-cell:active{transform:scale(0.95)}
.cal-cell.empty{background:transparent;border-color:transparent;cursor:default}
.cal-cell.today{border-color:var(--pri);font-weight:800}
.cal-cell-num{font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:700;line-height:1}
.dots-row{display:flex;gap:3px;margin-top:4px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;max-width:32px}
.dot{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block}


/* Modal */
.modal-overlay{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;background:rgba(0,0,0,0.65);display:none;justify-content:center;align-items:center;z-index:9999;padding:14px}
.modal-card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--bdr);border-radius:18px;max-width:440px;width:100%;max-height:90vh;overflow-y:auto;padding:18px;box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.35)}
.modal-title{font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:12px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
.machine-block{background:var(--sub);border:1px solid var(--bdr);border-radius:12px;padding:10px;margin-bottom:10px}
.machine-block h4{font-size:0.88rem;margin-bottom:6px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}
.round-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin-bottom:6px}
.round-row span{font-size:0.8rem;min-width:50px;color:var(--mut)}
.round-row input{padding:7px 10px;font-size:0.88rem}
.name-chip{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--bdr);color:var(--text);border-radius:18px;padding:4px 10px;font-size:0.78rem;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s,transform .1s}
.name-chip:hover{border-color:var(--pri)}
.name-chip:active{background:var(--pri);color:#fff;transform:scale(0.95)}
.summary-stat{background:var(--sub);border:1px solid var(--bdr);border-radius:12px;padding:12px;margin-top:14px}
.summary-stat table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:0.82rem;margin-top:6px}
.summary-stat th,.summary-stat td{padding:5px 6px;text-align:left;border-bottom:1px solid var(--bdr)}
.summary-stat th{color:var(--mut)}
</style>
</head>
<body data-theme="brown">
<div class="container" id="mainToolView">
  <div class="top-bar">
    <div>
      <p style="font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--text)">จัดทำโดย Wachira Chimraroeng</p>
      <p style="font-size:0.75rem;color:var(--mut);margin-top:2px">ไว้ใช้ส่วนตัวเพื่อสะดวกต่อการทำงานของตนเองล้วนๆ คนที่ใช้เเล้วชอบก็ขอบคุณครับ ขอให้เป็นวันที่ดี :3</p>
    </div>
    <div class="stats-box">
      <div id="liveClock" class="live-clock">⏱️ กำลังโหลดเวลา...</div>
      <div class="counter-row">
        <div class="counter-badge">👁️ ผู้เข้าใช้สะสม: <span id="visitCount" class="counter-num">...</span> ครั้ง</div>
        <div class="counter-badge">💾 ดาวน์โหลดสะสม: <span id="dlCount" class="counter-num">...</span> ครั้ง</div>
      </div>
    </div>


    <!-- แจ้งผู้ใช้ว่ารูปที่กดบันทึกจะถูกสำรองลง Drive (ติ๊กออกได้) -->
    <label class="backup-box" for="chkBackup">
      <input type="checkbox" id="chkBackup" checked onchange="saveBackupPref()">
      <span>☁️ สำรองรูปที่กดบันทึกไว้ใน Google Drive ของผู้พัฒนา
        <small>รูปที่คุณกดบันทึกจะถูกส่งไปเก็บสำเนาไว้ด้วย ถ้าไม่ต้องการให้เก็บ ให้ติ๊กช่องนี้ออก</small>
      </span>
    </label>


    <h1 style="font-size:1.2rem">จัดการรูปภาพ & รายงานตู้</h1>
    <div class="theme-selector">
      <span style="font-size:0.8rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--mut)">สีเว็บ:</span>
      <div class="theme-dot active" style="background:#3c2a1e" onclick="setTheme('brown')" title="สีน้ำตาล"></div>
      <div class="theme-dot" style="background:#09090b" onclick="setTheme('black')" title="สีดำ"></div>
      <div class="theme-dot" style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #ccc" onclick="setTheme('white')" title="สีขาว"></div>
      <div class="theme-dot" style="background:#f472b6" onclick="setTheme('pink')" title="สีชมพูอ่อน"></div>
      <div class="theme-dot" style="background:#475569" onclick="setTheme('gray')" title="สีเทา"></div>
    </div>
  </div>


  <div class="tabs">
    <button class="tab-btn" onclick="switchTab('tab2')">🖼️ 2 รูป</button>
    <button class="tab-btn active" onclick="switchTab('tab4')">📸 4 รูป/หลายรูป</button>
    <button class="tab-btn" onclick="switchTab('tabPdf')">📄 PDF</button>
    <button class="tab-btn" onclick="switchTab('tabMusic')">☕ สนับสนุน</button>
  </div>


  <!-- TAB 4 รูป & หลายรูป Auto Grid -->
  <div id="tab4" class="tab-panel active">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title">📸 1. รวม 4 รูป (2x2 มาตรฐาน)</div>
      <label class="btn btn-batch" style="cursor:pointer">⚡ กดที่นี่เพื่อเลือก 4 รูปพร้อมกันทีเดียว
        <input type="file" accept="image/*" multiple style="display:none" onchange="handleBatch4Upload(event)">
      </label>
      <div class="upload-grid-4">
        <div class="upload-box" id="box4_1"><input type="file" accept="image/*" onchange="handleSingle4Upload(event,0)"><div class="icon">①</div><span style="font-size:.78rem">บนซ้าย</span><img id="thumb4_0" class="preview-thumb"></div>
        <div class="upload-box" id="box4_2"><input type="file" accept="image/*" onchange="handleSingle4Upload(event,1)"><div class="icon">②</div><span style="font-size:.78rem">บนขวา</span><img id="thumb4_1" class="preview-thumb"></div>
        <div class="upload-box" id="box4_3"><input type="file" accept="image/*" onchange="handleSingle4Upload(event,2)"><div class="icon">③</div><span style="font-size:.78rem">ล่างซ้าย</span><img id="thumb4_2" class="preview-thumb"></div>
        <div class="upload-box" id="box4_4"><input type="file" accept="image/*" onchange="handleSingle4Upload(event,3)"><div class="icon">④</div><span style="font-size:.78rem">ล่างขวา</span><img id="thumb4_3" class="preview-thumb"></div>
      </div>


      <label>🎨 ฟิลเตอร์สีรูปภาพ</label>
      <div class="filter-row" id="filterRow4">
        <button type="button" class="filter-btn active" onclick="setFilter4('none', this)">ปกติ</button>
        <button type="button" class="filter-btn" onclick="setFilter4('dark', this)">🔥 สีเข้ม / คมชัด</button>
        <button type="button" class="filter-btn" onclick="setFilter4('bw', this)">🏁 ขาวดำ</button>
      </div>


      <label>📐 วิธีวางรูป (ซูม vs ไม่ซูม)</label>
      <div class="filter-row" id="fitRow4">
        <button type="button" class="filter-btn active" onclick="setFit4('cover', this)">🔍 เต็มช่อง (ซูมตัดขอบ)</button>
        <button type="button" class="filter-btn" onclick="setFit4('contain', this)">🖼️ ไม่ซูม (เห็นครบทั้งใบ)</button>
      </div>


      <label>📏 สัดส่วนภาพรวม</label>
      <div class="filter-row" id="ratioRow4">
        <button type="button" class="filter-btn active" onclick="setRatio4('1:1', this)">1:1 (จัตุรัส)</button>
        <button type="button" class="filter-btn" onclick="setRatio4('4:3', this)">4:3 (แนวนอน)</button>
        <button type="button" class="filter-btn" onclick="setRatio4('3:4', this)">3:4 (แนวตั้ง)</button>
        <button type="button" class="filter-btn" onclick="setRatio4('16:9', this)">16:9 (กว้าง)</button>
      </div>


      <div class="card-title" style="margin-top:10px">ข้อความตรงกลางรูป (ฟอนต์เดิม)</div>
      <div class="form-group"><label>ช่องที่ 1 (รหัสสาขา)</label><input type="text" id="txt4_code" value="14272"></div>
      <div class="form-group"><label>ช่องที่ 2 (ชื่อสาขา)</label><input type="text" id="txt4_name" value="บ้านโป่งไผ่"></div>
      <button class="btn" onclick="generateMerged4Image()">✨ รวมรูปภาพ 4 รูป (1:1)</button>
    </div>
    <div class="card result-container" id="resultCard4">
      <div class="card-title">🎉 ผลลัพธ์รูปภาพ 4 ช่อง</div>
      <div class="result-canvas-wrap"><canvas id="canvas4"></canvas></div>
      <button class="btn btn-success" onclick="downloadImage('canvas4','txt4_name','รายงาน_4รูป')">💾 บันทึกรูป 4 ช่อง (PNG)</button>
    </div>


    <!-- Auto Grid -->
    <div class="card" style="border: 2px dashed var(--pri);">
      <div class="card-title">🧩 2. รวมรูป Auto Grid (ใส่กี่รูปก็ได้ 1-10+ รูป)</div>
      <p style="font-size:0.82rem;color:var(--mut);margin-bottom:10px;">
        1 รูป = เต็มกรอบ | 2 รูป = คู่ซ้ายขวา | 3-4 รูป = 2x2 | 5-6 รูป = 3x2 | 7-9 รูป = 3x3 | 10+ รูป = จัดตารางอัตโนมัติ
      </p>


      <div class="upload-box" style="margin-bottom:12px;min-height:100px;">
        <input type="file" accept="image/*" multiple onchange="handleMultiGridUpload(event)">
        <div style="font-size:26px">🖼️</div>
        <span style="font-weight:700">แตะเพื่อเลือกรูปภาพ (เลือกกี่รูปก็ได้)</span>
        <div id="multiCountText" style="color:var(--pri);font-size:.82rem;font-weight:700;margin-top:4px"></div>
      </div>


      <label>🎨 สีพื้นหลังรูป (ช่องว่างระหว่างรูป)</label>
      <div class="palette-row">
        <div class="color-chip active" style="background:#ffffff" onclick="setMultiBg('#ffffff', this)" title="ขาว"></div>
        <div class="color-chip" style="background:#000000" onclick="setMultiBg('#000000', this)" title="ดำ"></div>
        <div class="color-chip" style="background:#2b1e16" onclick="setMultiBg('#2b1e16', this)" title="น้ำตาล"></div>
        <div class="color-chip" style="background:#475569" onclick="setMultiBg('#475569', this)" title="เทา"></div>
        <input type="color" id="pickerMultiBg" value="#ffffff" onchange="setMultiBg(this.value)" style="width:36px;height:34px;border:none;background:none;cursor:pointer;" title="เลือกสีเอง">
        <button type="button" class="btn" style="width:auto;padding:6px 12px;font-size:0.8rem;background:var(--sub);color:var(--text);border:1px solid var(--bdr);" onclick="randomMultiBg()">
          🎲 สุ่มสี
        </button>
      </div>


      <label>🎨 ฟิลเตอร์สีรูปภาพ</label>
      <div class="filter-row" id="filterRowMulti">
        <button type="button" class="filter-btn active" onclick="setFilterMulti('none', this)">ปกติ</button>
        <button type="button" class="filter-btn" onclick="setFilterMulti('dark', this)">🔥 สีเข้ม / คมชัด</button>
        <button type="button" class="filter-btn" onclick="setFilterMulti('bw', this)">🏁 ขาวดำ</button>
      </div>


      <label>📐 วิธีวางรูป (ซูม vs ไม่ซูม)</label>
      <div class="filter-row" id="fitRowMulti">
        <button type="button" class="filter-btn active" onclick="setFitMulti('cover', this)">🔍 เต็มช่อง (ซูมตัดขอบ)</button>
        <button type="button" class="filter-btn" onclick="setFitMulti('contain', this)">🖼️ ไม่ซูม (เห็นครบทั้งใบ)</button>
      </div>


      <label>📏 สัดส่วนภาพรวม</label>
      <div class="filter-row" id="ratioRowMulti">
